1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Thora Olafsdotter (Þóra Óláfsdóttir feilans)=
2 CONT
2 CONT * Daughter of Ólafur "Feilan" Þorsteinsson and Álfdís Konálsdóttir 
2 CONT * She lived at Helgafell, Western Norway, Iceland
2 CONT * Birth: circa 914 in Hvammur, Dalabyggð, Vesturland, Iceland
2 CONT * Death:	940 (22-30)  in Helgafell, Snæfellsnes, Iceland
2 CONT
2 CONT Hallvard worked for Thora after Torstein's death and they had their son mothers together Þóra Óláfsdóttir felans Name / Precedence: Thora Location: Vestl. Island Relations: Married to Thorstein Codbites. Sister of Thord Geller. Mo
2 CONC ther of Thorgrim, Thick Bork and Mår Halvardson. Sources: Landnamabogen 73, S109
2 CONT
2 CONT =Married=
2 CONT
2 CONT * Married: '''Torstein "Cod-biter or Torskabit" Þórólfsson,''' they had the children
2 CONT
2 CONT * Married: '''Hallvard,''' they had a son Mår Halvardsson 
2 CONT
2 CONT =Children with Torstein "Cod-biter or Torskabit" Þórólfsson=
2 CONT
2 CONT Torstein drowned when he rowed from Höskuldsey in 938
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Thordis Þorsteinsdóttir;'''
2 CONT * '''Barkar Digre Thorsteinsson;'''
2 CONT * '''Thorgrim "Godi" Þorsteinsson''' 
2 CONT
2 CONT =Child with Hallvard=
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Mår Halvardsson'''
2 CONT
