1 NOTE He was an Icelandic settler who first took possession of land between Jokul's River and Lons Moor in the north, farming at Bær for ten years or more. Then he learned his highseat pillars were in Leiru Creek and moved there. With I
2 CONC ngjolf's approval, he took possession of land between Ulvar's River and Leiru Creek, living at Skjeggastad.
