1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT =Helgesson, (Ingjaldr Helgason)=
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Småkonge, Vikingkonge i Irland''' 
2 CONT
2 CONT * Ingjald var sønn av Helge og Thora
2 CONT * Hans kone er ukjent, de hadde sønnen Olav Kvite 
2 CONT
2 CONT Ingjaldr Helgason 1 Tilnavn / fordanskning: Ingjald Lokalitet: Vestl. Island Relationer: Søn af Helge Olafson. Fader til Oleif den Hvide. Kilder: Landnamabogen: 82 
2 CONT
2 CONT Ingjaldr Helgason 2 Tilnavn / fordanskning: Ingjald Lokalitet:Relationer: Efterkommer af Ynglingeslægten. 
2 CONT Kilder: Islændingebogen: Tillæg 2; Noter: Muligvis identisk med Ingjaldr Helgason 1.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://heimskringla.no/wiki/Landnamabogen
2 CONT
2 CONT Ingjald "Kvite", Viking king in Ireland.
2 CONT == Basics ==
2 CONT * Father: Helge, son of Olaf Gudrødsson, grandson of Halfdan Kvitbein
2 CONT * Mother: Thora, daughter of Sigurd Orm-i-auga, son of Ragnar Lodbrok.
2 CONT * Wife: Unknown
2 CONT ** Son: Olaf the White
2 CONT
2 CONT =Sources =
2 CONT
2 CONT Forte, Angelo, Richard Oram and Frederik Pedersen. Viking Empires. Cambridge: Cambridge University Press, 2005 ISBN 0-521-82992-5.
2 CONT
2 CONT See also http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ingjald_Helgasson
2 CONT
2 CONT The text from "Landnåmabok" that mentions him seems to be:
2 CONT
2 CONT Óleifur hinn hvíti hét herkonungur; hann var son Ingjalds konungs Helgasonar, Óláfssonar, Guðröðarsonar, Hálfdanarsonar hvítbeins Upplendingakonungs
2 CONT
2 CONT (36. kafli from http://www.snerpa.is/net/snorri/landnama.htm)
2 CONT
2 CONT Eyrbyggja saga says:
2 CONT
2 CONT Ketill flatnefur gifti Auði dóttur sína Ólafi hvíta er þá var mestur herkonungur fyrir vestan haf. Hann var sonur Ingjalds Helgasonar en móðir Ingjalds var Þóra, dóttir Sigurðar orms í auga, Ragnarssonar loðbrókar.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.sagadb.org/eyrbyggja_saga
2 CONT
2 CONT =In English:=
2 CONT
2 CONT Ketil Flatneb gave his daughter Auth to Olaf the White, who at that time was the greatest war-king West-over-the-sea; he was the son of Ingiald, the son of Helgi; but the mother of Ingiald was Thora, the daughter of Sigurd Worm-in
2 CONC -eye, the son of Ragnar Hairy-breeks.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.sagadb.org/eyrbyggja_saga.en
2 CONT
2 CONT =Alternate sources =
2 CONT
2 CONT The Laxdale saga mentions Ingjald again, with a different father's name:
2 CONT
2 CONT Unn "the Deep-minded" was another of Ketill's daughters, and was the wife of Olaf the White, son of Ingjald, who was son of Frodi the Valiant, who was slain by the Svertlings.
2 CONT
2 CONT (http://www.sagadb.org/laxdaela_saga.en)
2 CONT
2 CONT For the purpose of being consistent on Geni, we'll ignore the Laxdale saga.
2 CONT
2 CONT =Other Info =
2 CONT
2 CONT Ingjald Helgasson[1] was a Hiberno-Norse chieftain of the ninth century AD. According to the Landnamabok he was the son of Helgi, the son of Olaf, the son of Gudrod, the son of Halfdan Hvitbeinn; he was thus distantly related to t
2 CONC he Yngling kings of Vestfold and later Norway. According to Eyrbyggja saga, Ingjald's mother was Thora, the daughter of Sigurd Snake-in-the-Eye who was a son of Ragnar Lodbrok.
2 CONT
2 CONT Ingjald had at least one son, Olaf the White, who became King of Dublin.
2 CONT
2 CONT =Notes=
2 CONT
2 CONT * In some sources his father's name is given as Olaf. In Laxdaela Saga his father's name is given as "King Frodi the Valiant, who was slain by Jarl Sverting and his sons."
2 CONT [edit] References Forte, Angelo, Richard Oram and Frederik Pedersen. Viking Empires. Cambridge: Cambridge University Press, 2005 ISBN 0-521-82992-5.
2 CONT
2 CONT * The Laxardal Saga says that Ingjald was "the son of Frodi the Valiant, who was killed by the descendants of Earl Sverting." Here it is shown his father is Helge Olavsson. The Saga of Eirik the Red also says his father was "Helgi
2 CONC , the son of Olaf".
