1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Annals of Ulster''' U842.13 – “Dúngall son of Fergal, king of Osraige, dies.” [https://celt.ucc.ie/published/T100001A.html]
2 CONT '''Book of Leinster Section 29 “Reges Ossairge”''' [5665] {MS folio 40e} ''Kings of Ossairge'' [https://celt.ucc.ie/published/G800011A/]
2 CONT Fergal, son of Anmchada
2 CONT Dungal mac Fergaile .xl 
