1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Olav Gudrødsson (Oláfr Goðrøðarson)==
2 CONT
2 CONT * Olav was the son of Gudrød, his mother was unknown.
2 CONT * His wife is unknown, they had son Helge
2 CONT * Oláfr Goðrøðarson First name / surname: Olaf Location: Norway Relations: Ancestor of Oleif den Hvide, who was married to Aud den Dybsindige. Sources: The Icelander Book: Appendix 2; Country Name Book: 82 Notes:
2 CONT * Oleif the White was called an army king; he was the son of King Ingjald, son of Helge, son of Olaf, son of Gudrød, son of Halfdan Hvidben, king of Upland.
