2 CONT "Sigurd got the nickname from his mother Aslaug who said that she had seen into his eyes and he knows that a dragon is more and other than a man. He know that a dragon lives in the mind of people and enslaves it. That is why I cal
2 CONC l him Sigurd Ormeøje." plus the genealogies
