1 NOTE RESEARCH NOTES:
2 CONT "Shaggy pants", King of Denmark (750-794).  Danish & Swedish sea-viking
2 CONT Let sack of Paris in 845.
2 CONT Ragnar Lodbrok er trolig en historisk skikkelse, men dateringen of ham er
2 CONT usikker. Det har vaert hevdet at det kan vaere snakk if to personer, Ragnar
2 CONT Lodbrok den eldre and den yngre.
2 CONT Ragnarr Lodbr¢k or Ragnar Lodbrok was a semi-legendary King of Denmark and
2 CONT Sweden who reigned sometime in the eighth or ninth centuries. Although he is
2 CONT something of a hero in his native Scandinavia, reliable accounts of his life
2 CONT are very sketchy and heavily based on ancient Viking sagas. Even the dating of
2 CONT his reign is not certain; there are sources that date it from 750- 794, and
2 CONT others from 860- 865. Neither matches with what we know of him, and he
2 CONT probably held power as a warlord from approximately 835 to his death in 865,
2 CONT perhaps only being recognized as king in the last five years of his life.
1 NOTE Källa: http://ulf.lrsn.se/index.html
1 NOTE Nedan från
1 NOTE He conquered or inherited large sections of Norway, Sweden and Denmark. His armies overran Europe.
1 NOTE He was the leader of a flotilla of 120 ships,which, in 1845, rode up the Seine to Paris. Charles the Bald paid them 7,000 pounds of silver so they wouldn's burn Paris.
