2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Halfdan Frodasson - was born about 0503 in Denmark. He is the son of Frodi Fridleifsson. Halfdan married Sigris about 0523 in Denmark. Sigris was born about 0507 in Denmark.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children: 
2 CONT
2 CONT i. 	Helgi Halfdansson was born about 0528 in Denmark. See #38. below. ii. 	Hroar Halfdansson was born about 0526 in Roskilde, Denmark.
