1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Hrolf krakes saga
2 CONT
2 CONT ---- Men da han kommer inn der står Reginn foran ham, og ser ikke mye fredelig ut. Kongen snur da tilbake, og han brenner inne der sammen med mye folk. Sigrid, mor til brødrene Hroar og Helgi, brant inne der fordi hun ikke ville g
2 CONC å ut.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sigrid was born about 480 in Denmark. She died in 528/581. She married Halfdan Frodasson King of Danes about 505 in Sweden.
2 CONT
2 CONT They had the following children:
2 CONT
2 CONT       		M 	i 	Hroar Halfdansson King of Danes
2 CONT
2 CONT       		F 	ii 	Signa Halfdansdotter
2 CONT
2 CONT       		F 	iii 	Helga Halfdansdotter
2 CONT
