2 CONT http://homepages.rootsweb.ancestry.com/~cousin/html/p298.htm#i9378
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Son till Halvdan Snälle av Skjöldungaätten (se under Ingjald Illråde) och därmed ättling till Oden. Erövrade sveaväldet efter innebränningen av Ingjald Illråde. Ska sedan ha underlagt sig hela Norden inklusive Danmark. Gift med en
2 CONC  dotter till Heidrek (son till Angantyr, kung i Småland). I Danmark satte han sin dotters (Aud Djupaudga) make Hrörek till underkonung men lät senare dräpa honom. Aud Djupaudga gifte senare om sig med Radbjart av Ryssland.
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT cita. Vidframe means "Wide Fathom from Skane". Ivar was a king of Sweden, Norway, Denmark, and parts of England and was from the house of Skjöldung. He began as king of Scania and conquered Sweden by defeating Ingjald. He is then 
2 CONC said to have conquered all of Scandinavia and parts of England. Because of his harsh rule, many Swedes fled west and populated Wermelandia under its king Olof Trätälja. His last campaign was in Russia where he died , defeated by O
2 CONC din in disguise. His reign is held by legend to have been the Golden Age of Ancient Northmen.
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT King of UPPSALA & Lethra; aka Ivar VIFADME (Vidfama Vidfamus Vidfamne); his vast domain probably included Staraya LADOGA; 1st King of the SKJOLDUNG (SCYLDING) Dynasty
