2 CONT 1. "Royalty for Commoners",
2 CONT
2 CONT Roderick W. Stuart, 1992, 2nd edition. This book lists all of the known ancestors of John of Gaunt, which amounts to most of the Medieval royalty of Europe. Also see the following article: "A Mediaeval Miscellany: Commentaries on 
2 CONC Roderick W. Stuart's Royalty for Commoners," The American Genealogist 69 (April 1994)
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Frodi Fridleifsson was born in 479 in Denmark. He died in 507/570. He was married about 492 in Denmark.
2 CONT
2 CONT He had the following children:
2 CONT
2 CONT M i Halfdan Frodasson King of Danes M ii Ingjald Frodasson 1 was born 2 about 501 in Denmark. [Notes] M iii Frodi Frodasson 1 was born 2 about 505 in Denmark. [Notes]
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Frodi Fridleifsson - was born about 0479 in Denmark. He is the son of Fridleif Frodasson.
