1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Succession of Kings from ''Book of Leinster''==
2 CONT formerly ''Lebar na Núachongbála'' section 97 {folio 337h). [https://celt.ucc.ie/published/G800011F/text097.html]
2 CONT '''In the original record''', lower case '''m''' or '''mc''' appear. In the list below, I've replace them with '''mac'''.
