1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Figure of the Orkneysaga.
2 CONT
2 CONT The mention of him is brief; when introducing Hrolf of the Hill, it says "he was the son of Svadi the giant from north of the Dovrefell".
2 CONT
2 CONT Date of birth is totally undocumented, and chosen to fit with surrounding profiles.
2 CONT
2 CONT Note - a speculation published in "Gjallarhorn", a genealogical magazine published in Norway, proposes that his name was Finn, and that his father was Hjorvard Helgesson. I have not verified the article's existence or authorship, 
2 CONC or what sources it cites. - Harald Alvestrand
2 CONT
