2 CONT ==Sources==
2 CONT * [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/R%C3%A1%C3%B0bar%C3%B0r Wikipedia (English)]
2 CONT * [http://www.sacred-texts.com/neu/poe/poe15.htm Hyndaljod]
