2 CONT Randvér or Randver was viceroy of Sweden and the son of the Varangian Radbjart and Aud the daughter of Ivar Vidfamne. He was married to Ingild, the daughter of an unknown Swedish king. He was succeeded by his son Sigurd Ring.
