1 NOTE King Ingiald (Ill-Ruler) lived in the 7th Century, last of the Frey-born Yngling pagan sacral "Peace Kings of Uppsala).  His emblem was the moon-crescent-shaped Galley. Later symbol of the Royal Scots lines.
