2 CONT
2 CONT Fridleif III Fordisson, King of the Danes||p111.htm#i13321|Frode III "the Pacific" Dansson, King of the Danes|b. c 433\nd. 310|p285.htm#i13322||||Dan M. Ó., King of the Danes||p279.htm#i13323||||||||||
2 CONT
2 CONT Father	Frode III "the Pacific" Dansson, King of the Danes1 b. circa 433, d. 310
2 CONT
2 CONT      Fridleif III Fordisson, King of the Danes was the son of Frode III "the Pacific" Dansson, King of the Danes.1
2 CONT
2 CONT Family
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Child	
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Frode IV Fridleifsson, King of the Danes+ 2,3
2 CONT ***********************
2 CONT
2 CONT Fridleif III, king of Lejre, Denmark.
2 CONT
2 CONT Fridleif was the son of Frode and Ingebjørg. He was married to Hide, they had his son Åle, with unknown wife he had son Frode the brave
2 CONT
2 CONT "King after his brother Nothing is written and we can probably assume that he was quite peaceful, reigned for about twenty years."
2 CONT
2 CONT "Fredleif followed immediately after his father in the king's power; he wished that within the realms of his kingdom neither idolatry nor sorcery nor magic be practiced; for he fully relied on his own bravery and his weapons. by s
2 CONC electing a crowd of the strongest and most capable men, whom he also entertained roundly, among them the famous warrior Starkad, who had recently returned from trips to Italy, Russia and Hungary, where he, like most other places, 
2 CONC had left a perpetual memory of his bravery.
2 CONT
2 CONT Fredleif forcibly rescued g.1 Hild, daughter of Åle, king of the Oplands in Norway, and married her; with her he got his son Åle, g.2 with another woman he got his son Frode Fridleifsson. "
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.olhov.net/danmark.html#Frode Peace
