2 CONT Haraldr Valdarsson, King of Roeskilde||p78.htm#i10098|Valdar Hroarsson, King of Roeskilde||p78.htm#i10099|Hildis|b. b 530\nd. c 572|p293.htm#i10100|Hroar H., King of Roeskilde||p78.htm#i10102|Ogne of Northumbria||p78.htm#i10103|Hi
2 CONC lderic, King of the Vandals|b. c 500\nd. 530|p291.htm#i10101|Amalafrida|b. b 496|p83.htm#i10654|
2 CONT
2 CONT Father	Valdar Hroarsson, King of Roeskilde
2 CONT
2 CONT Mother	Hildis3 b. before 530, d. circa 572
2 CONT
2 CONT      Haraldr Valdarsson, King of Roeskilde was the son of Valdar Hroarsson, King of Roeskilde and Hildis.3
