1 NOTE King in Svitjod from 545 to 565. Onund was one of the most popular kings. He built roads, hence his name, cleared land and brought it into cultivation. As Onund was passing through a deep, narrow, valley following heavy rains, he 
2 CONC and many of his party were buried by a landslide. 
