2 CONT Brief Life History of Virfill
2 CONT
2 CONT Virfill Vemundarsson the Sea King was born in 0380, in Ringerike, Buskerud, Norway as the son of Vemundar Ingjaldson and Auðr Ívarsdóttir. He married Eimyrja Logisdottir about 0429, in Ringerike, Buskerud, Norway. They were the pa
2 CONC rents of at least 1 son and 2 daughters. He died in 0455, in his hometown, at the age of 75.
