2 CONC  Yrsa; father of Yngvar. [History of Sweden, p. 38] Son of Adils 'den Mèaktige' Ottarsson and Yrsa Olafsdottir; father of Yngvar 'the Tall' Eysteinsson. [Bob Furtaw Son of Adils Ottarsson and Yrsa Helgasdottir; father of: 1. Ingva
2 CONC r 'the Tall' Eysteinsson 2. Brotanund Eysteinsson Reference Number: G6T0-45 IG
