2 CONT     1. Yrsa md her father--Helgi Halfdansson
1 NOTE Yrsa Helgasdotter, b. ca. 450 in Denmark, m. Helgi Halfdansson, King of Denmark, ca. 490 
2 CONT         Father: Helgi Halfdansson, King of Denmark
2 CONT         Mother: Alof "the Great"
2 CONT Yrsa was taken prisoner by, and made the wife of, King Helgi of Denmark. 
2 CONT (Drama) She later found out that King Helgi was her own father and her mother was Queen Alof the Great, wife of King Geirthjof of Saxland. 
2 CONT Yrsa's son by Helge, Rolf Krake, later became king of Denmark.
2 CONT
2 CONT She Married ca. 470 in Sweden.
