1 NOTE Helge Halvdansson
2 CONT Stor kriger og hærmann. Ektet sin egen 
2 CONT datter Yrsa etter hærferd til Svitjod mot kong 
2 CONT Adils. Helge døde på hærferd da sønnen 
2 CONT Rolv var åtte år.
2 CONT Rolv Helgesson Krake,
2 CONT konge etter 
2 CONT sin far.
1 NOTE !RESEARCH NOTES:
2 CONT       1. Helgi md (2) Yrsa Helgasson (He did not know at the time she was his owndaughter)
2 CONT !SOURCES:
2 CONT       1. The Viking Age, Gen. Hist. 19, v. 1, p. 68
2 CONT       2. Keiser und Koenig Hist., Gen. Hist. 25, pt 1, p. 126-27
2 CONT       3. The Saga Library "Heimskringla", F Ice 1, p. 223 of last Index
1 NOTE !RESEARCH NOTES:
2 CONT     1. Helgi md (2) Yrsa Helgasson (He did not know at the time she was his owndaughter)
2 CONT !SOURCES:
