2 CONT
2 CONT Angantyr married Svofu Bjartmarsdatter, daughter of Bjartmar and Unknown. (Svofu Bjartmarsdatter was born about 0474 in , , , Norway 19.)
2 CONT
2 CONT http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Angantyr
2 CONT
2 CONT Hadde 11 brødre
