1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Arngrim was a berserker, who figures in Hervarar saga, Gesta Danorum, Lay of Hyndla, a number of Faroese ballads and Orvar-Odd's saga in Norse mythology.
2 CONT
2 CONT According to versions H and U, Arngrim went pillaging to Gardariki and met its king Svafrlami, who was in possession of Tyrfing at the moment. Tyrfing cut through Arngrim's shield and down into the soil, whereupon Arngrim cut off 
2 CONC Svafrlami's hand, grabbed the sword and slew him with his own weapon. Then Arngrim captured Svafrlami's daughter Eyfura and forced her to marry him.
2 CONT
2 CONT Version R, however relates that Arngrim became Sigrlami's war-chief and won many battles and conquered land and subjects for the old king. In recompense, Arngrim was given a high position in the realm, Eyfura and Tyrfing.
2 CONT
2 CONT In all versions of the saga, Arngrim returned to Bolmsö with Eyfura (although versions H and U say that it was the island Bolm in Hålogaland). They had twelve sons who all followed in their father's footsteps and became berserkers
2 CONC . According to the U version, they were called Angantyr, Hjörvard, Hervard, Hrani, Barri, Tyrfing, Tind, two Haddings, Bui, Bild and Toki. According to the H version, their names were Angantyr, Hjorvard, Hervard, Hrani, Brami, Bar
2 CONC ri, Reifnir, Tind, Saeming and Bui and the two Haddings (in version R only six are mentioned: Angantyr, Hjörvard, Hervard, Hrani and the two Haddings).
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Born: Abt 0452, Bolmey, , , Norway 19 
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage: Eyfuru Svaflamasdatter 
2 CONT
2 CONT    Noted events in his life were:• Fact 12: aka: Berserkur. 19  http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Arngrim
2 CONT
2 CONT  Arngrim married Eyfuru Svaflamasdatter, daughter of Svaflama and Unknown. (Eyfuru Svaflamasdatter was born about 0454 in Gordum, , , Norway 19.)
