1 NOTE Han var konge over Svear. Far til Egil Tunnadolg.. REFN:  SEF Bs:51
1 NOTE This guy was a FREAK! He apparently ( according to legend of course) sacrificed one of his sons to Odin every ten years to prolong his life. It worked. After sacrificing 9 of his sons he was 190 years old and then his subjects for
2 CONC bade him to do it again and he died of extreme old age. At the end he was so weak that he had to suck nourishment from a horn like a baby. He missed out on the glorious death of Vikings by not dying in battle.
