2 CONT Burned to death by sons in his hall. Succeeded his father Vanlande; m. the dau. of Aude the Rich, whom he afterward left and took another wife, bringing on himself a curse by so doing. Visbur's sons fell unexpectedly over him, bur
2 CONC ning him in his house. Domalde, his son, succeeded him. [History of Sweden, p. 35]
