0 @N6000000003635727552@ NOTE [4704] "Bloodline ... ", p 427-31
0 @N6000000003949700830@ NOTE After the death of Olaf Aud and Thorstein went to live in the Hebrides, then under Ketil's rule. Thorstein eventually became a warlord and allied with the Jarl of Orkney, Sigurd Eysteinsson. Together Thorstein and Sigurd waged a s
1 CONC eries of campaigns in Caithness, Sutherland, Ross, Moray, and a number of other regions, eventually receiving tribute from half of Scotland. However, the Scottish chieftains plotted against Thorstein, and he was killed; the exact 
1 CONC nature of his death is unknown but it probably took place around 880 or 890.
0 @N6000000000437382230@ NOTE Name Suffix:<NSFX> Earl Of Caithness & Sutherland
0 @N6000000007329349763@ NOTE [MAGNUS.FTW]
1 CONT
1 CONT Herjet i Skottland, vant halve landet og ble konge der. Men skottene gjorde
1 CONT opprør, og han falt der.
