0 @N6000000003300441815@ NOTE Yrsa13 Helgasson was born in Denmark about 565. She married twice. She ma rried Helgi Halfdansson in Denmark. Helgi was born in Denmark about 528 . Helgi was the son of Halfdan Frodasson and Sigris Mrs Frodasson. Helg i was baptiz
1 CONC ed a member of The Church of Jesus Christ of Latter-day Saint s June 25, 1878. Temple Code: temple code unknown. He was endowed June 27 , 1907. Temple Code: temple code unknown. Helgi and Mrs-Olof "The Mighty " Halfdansson were se
1 CONC aled December 16, 1954. Temple Code: temple code unk nown. He was sealed to his parents September 16, 1955. Temple Code: SL. S he married Adils Ottarsson. Adils was born in Sweden about 572. Adils wa s the son of Ottar and Mrs Ott
1 CONC ar Egilsson. Adils was baptized a member o f The Church of Jesus Christ of Latter-day Saints May 28, 1923. Temple Co de: temple code unknown. He was endowed May 2, 1928. Temple Code: templ e code unknown. Adils and Yrsa Helgasson 
1 CONC were sealed December 18, 1953. T emple Code: temple code unknown. (See Adils Ottarsson for the continuatio n of this line.)
